      "changes": 23,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/blob/7b2efa5cea38e4d4d97dd0e63b28b9148623da59/data%2Fchangelog.txt",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/raw/7b2efa5cea38e4d4d97dd0e63b28b9148623da59/data%2Fchangelog.txt",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/contents/data%2Fchangelog.txt?ref=7b2efa5cea38e4d4d97dd0e63b28b9148623da59",
      "patch": "@@ -1,3 +1,26 @@\n+# 0.I-1\n+\n+## Bugfixes and improvements:\n+Item info panel can now be scrolled properly\n+Game no longer shows an error about layering.json when using MSXotto+ tileset\n+Terminal version of the game no longer has up 100% CPU usage\n+Fixed LIXA teleportation, clarified text about entering LIXA and added alternative entry method\n+Fixed zone-related crashed on loading a save\n+Allow player to pick up items NPCs have reserved for tasks\n+Tools recharging from a car catch up their charging when returning to reality bubble\n+Show \"not castable\" message in spellbook menu only when spells are actually not castable\n+Actual NPC name shown instead of <npcname> for messages whe NPC wields an item\n+Wooden floors are now deconstructed with a nail puller instead of angle grinder\n+Removed error messages about inconsistent morale\n+Food heating UI now shows right amount of time and energy for charge-based items\n+AR glasses can now take photos and store data correctly\n+Fixed a bug that sometimes removed temporary morale bonuses\n+Aftershock: Lynx Explorer vehicle bought from salvor encampment is now your property, not UICA's\n+Magiclysm: Giant Growth spell can no longer be spammed\n+Mind Over Matter: monster taking unsourced damage with Obscurity in effect will no longer crash the game\n+Innawood: bronze tongs can be made without already having tongs\n+\n+\n # 0.I\n \n ## Highlights:"
    },
